@startuml
title LoraTrack — UML Component Architecture
caption Logical component view · Customer and production scope · Document version 1.5

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #496779
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #1F6F8B
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #F8FBFC
skinparam InterfaceBorderColor #1F6F8B
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #A97812
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFF9E8

actor "Business User" as User
actor "Organization Administrator" as Admin
cloud "Telemetry Providers\nTTI / Meraki" as WebhookProviders <<external systems>>
cloud "Identity, Catalog, MQTT\nand Email Services" as ExternalServices <<external systems>>

interface "IUserAccess\nHTTPS" as IUserAccess
interface "ITelemetryWebhook\nHTTPS" as IWebhook

package "LoraTrack Modular Monolith" <<single deployable system>> {
  package "Presentation" <<layer>> {
    component "LoraTrack Application" as Web <<modular monolith>>
    component "Dashboard and Reporting" as Dashboard
  }

  package "Operational Services" <<layer>> {
    component "Identity and Access" as IAM
    component "Catalog, Assets and Devices" as Assets
    component "Locations and Maps" as Locations
    component "Connector Administration" as Connectors
  }

  package "Telemetry Processing" <<layer>> {
    component "Webhook Intake" as Intake <<synchronous boundary>>
    component "Durable Ingestion Inbox" as Inbox <<idempotency boundary>>
    component "Scheduled Processor" as Processor <<bounded batches>>
    component "Positioning and Alerts" as Positioning <<domain services>>
  }

  package "Provider Boundary" <<layer>> {
    component "Identity Adapter" as IdentityAdapter
    component "Telemetry Adapters" as TelemetryAdapters
    component "Catalog Adapters" as CatalogAdapters
    component "Notification Adapter" as NotificationAdapter
  }

  package "Persistence Boundary" <<layer>> {
    component "Persistence Gateway" as Persistence
    database "Operational Database" as Database <<MySQL / MariaDB>>
    artifact "Private File Store" as Files <<floor plans>>
  }
}

User --> IUserAccess : uses
Admin --> IUserAccess : administers
IUserAccess - Web : provided interface
WebhookProviders --> IWebhook : authenticated delivery
IWebhook - Intake : provided interface

Web ..> IAM
Web ..> Assets
Web ..> Locations
Web ..> Connectors
Web ..> Dashboard

Intake --> Inbox : validate and persist
Processor --> Inbox : claim bounded batch
Processor --> TelemetryAdapters : normalize and deduplicate
Processor --> Positioning : create observations

IAM ..> IdentityAdapter
Connectors ..> TelemetryAdapters
Connectors ..> CatalogAdapters
Positioning ..> NotificationAdapter
IdentityAdapter --> ExternalServices : OAuth 2.0 / OIDC
TelemetryAdapters --> ExternalServices : MQTT/TLS (optional)
CatalogAdapters --> ExternalServices : HTTPS APIs
NotificationAdapter --> ExternalServices : SMTP/TLS

Dashboard ..> Persistence
Inbox ..> Persistence
Processor ..> Persistence
Persistence --> Database : SQL over TLS
Locations --> Files : controlled access

@enduml
